<p>The benchmark for premium PU finishes in India. Best-in-class UV stability, deep colour saturation, excellent customer support. Slightly more expensive than Indian brands; usually worth it on signature projects.</p>
<p>Luxury tier</p>
<p>Sirca</p>
<p>Italian · Premium</p>
<p>Close competitor to ICA. Particularly strong on textured and metallic finishes. Widely specified by architects working on hospitality and high-end residential.</p>
<p>Luxury tier</p>
<p>Milesi (IVM Chemicals)</p>
<p>Italian · Premium · Wood-friendly</p>
<p>Particularly good if PU is being applied over veneer or solid wood — the resin chemistry preserves the substrate's character better than most. Niche but excellent.</p>
<p>Luxury tier</p>
